00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:31.440
<v Dan Taberski>Right. Like, we're going to go a step further than your iPhone video or your body cam. We will bring it to you live. It doesn't get more real than this. That's their position. So here's a promotional video they put up.
<v Dan Taberski>没错。就像，我们要比你的 iPhone 视频或执法记录仪更进一步。我们将为您带来现场直播。没有比这更真实的了。这就是他们的立场。这是他们发布的宣传视频。

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:37.380
<v Man 1>Being able to see exactly what the police are doing and how they're doing it is beneficial to everyone.
