<v Officer>Sure. OK. Do you have shoes? Let's walk out. Come on. Let's get you out of this nice gentleman's trailer so he can enjoy his evening.
<v Officer>当然。好吧。你有鞋子吗？我们走吧。来吧。让我们带你离开这位绅士的拖车，让他可以享受他的夜晚。

