<v Dan Taberski>They don't explain where or why they're even moving her, and they don't wait for shoes. There are six inches of snow on the ground, and they drag her through it in her pink socks.
<v Dan Taberski>他们甚至没有解释他们为什么要带走她，也没等她穿鞋。地上有 6 英寸厚的雪，他们拖着她走过雪地，她脚上只穿着粉红色的袜子。

