00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:06.410
<v Officer>Hey, relax. He's just making sure you don't have anything on you.
<v Officer>嘿，放松。他只是在确保你身上没有携带任何东西。

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:08.270
<v Amy>I have no shirt on underneath!
<v Amy>我里面没穿衬衫！

00:22:08.270 --> 00:22:09.760
<v Officer>So what? You have a sweatshirt on.
<v Officer>那又怎样？你穿了一件卫衣。

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.120
<v Amy>[INAUDIBLE] I'm not a whore.
<v Amy>[听不清] 我不是妓女。

