<v Officer>OK, good.
<v Officer>好吧，很好。

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:20.910
<v Dan Taberski>The officer arrests her and her boyfriend and puts them both in the same cop car. And host Dan Abrams gives this commentary at the end.
<v Dan Taberski>警官逮捕了她和她的男友，把他们都塞进了同一辆警车。主持人 Dan Abrams 在最后做了点评。

00:22:20.910 --> 00:22:28.000
<v Dan Abrams>It seems those who steal together stay together. And they're together now in the back seat of that car, both with outstanding warrants.
<v Dan Abrams>看来那些一起偷东西的人会待在一起。他们现在在一起坐在那辆车的后座上，都有未执行的逮捕令。

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:30.680
<v Dan Taberski>And that's it. We don't see her again in the episode.
<v Dan Taberski>就是这样。我们在那一集里没再见到她。

00:22:30.680 --> 00:22:39.610
<v Dan Abrams>Let's go to Richland County in South Carolina.
<v Dan Abrams>让我们去南卡罗来纳州的里奇兰县。

00:22:39.610 --> 00:22:42.410
<v Dan Taberski>Do you remember it at all?
<v Dan Taberski>你完全记得吗？

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:44.840
<v Amy>Just bits and pieces.
<v Amy>只有零星片段。

00:22:44.840 --> 00:22:56.210
<v Dan Taberski>We met Amy at her parents' home on a street that dead ends at the Spokane River. Amy doesn't ask us in. We sit and talk on a couple lawn chairs in the front yard. It's still patched with melting snow.
<v Dan Taberski>我们在 Amy 父母家的前院遇到了她，那条街终点是斯波坎河。Amy 没有让我们进屋。我们在前院的几把草坪椅上坐着谈话。地上还零星铺着融化的雪。

00:22:56.210 --> 00:23:06.350
<v Amy>That afternoon, I remember having a drink. And I'm a drinker, obviously. And I have no recollection after this, just, cup of alcohol.
