<v Amy>No.
<v Amy>不记得。

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:09.510
<v Dan Taberski>Literally do not remember it.
<v Dan Taberski>真的完全不记得。

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:12.260
<v Amy>No, I have no fucking clue.
<v Amy>不，我他妈完全没头绪。

00:23:12.260 --> 00:23:21.710
<v Dan Taberski>Do you remember the cops picking you up and helping you out of that house? Do you remember walking through the snow?
<v Dan Taberski>你记得警察扶你走出那个房子吗？你记得走过雪地吗？

