<v Officer>She is drunk.
<v Officer>她喝醉了。

00:26:07.650 --> 00:26:13.770
<v Dan Taberski>And what's more, she was afraid her Live PD appearance would just make her look guilty before she even had a trial.
<v Dan Taberski>而且更重要的是，她担心她的《Live PD》出镜会让她在还没受审之前看起来就有罪。

00:26:13.770 --> 00:26:18.470
<v Amy>Been there for them to say I'm going to jail on a fucking stolen property-- Jesus.
<v Amy>在那里，他们说我要因为该死的持有赃物去坐牢——天呐。

