<v Dan Taberski>Because now everyone's assuming that you stole property, instead of-- or somebody going--
<v Dan Taberski>因为现在每个人都假设你偷了东西，而不是——或者有人去——

00:26:22.870 --> 00:26:41.400
<v Amy>Yeah, before I even fucking go to trial. And if I don't beat my trial, thanks a lot, fucking Live PD. Do you understand what I mean? Already, I looked like a piece of shit. That's fucking another nail in my coffin. And it's just like you-- yeah.
<v Amy>是的，在我他妈去受审之前。如果我审判没赢，谢了啊，该死的《Live PD》。你明白我的意思吗？我已经看起来像个渣滓了。那是我棺材上的另一根钉子。这就像你——是的。

